<Mod id="523b9731-6348-15a3-77fd-26303c13dc91" version="2.1">
  <Properties>
    <Name>UI - Horizontal Leaders' Portraits for VP</Name>
    <Stability>Alpha</Stability>
    <Teaser></Teaser>
    <Description>The diplomacy list with all the leaders portrait that is displayed on the right side of the screen on a vertical orientation is now displayed on a horizontal line, similar to newer civilization games. This comes with a drawback, I removed the extra floating text like score, gold and trade items that were displayed right before the portraits (still present in tooltip) and also the list with city-states (Trade Opportunities for VP as a solution for city-states).</Description>
    <Authors>Aqinu</Authors>
    <HideSetupGame>0</HideSetupGame>
    <AffectsSavedGames>0</AffectsSavedGames>
    <SupportsSinglePlayer>1</SupportsSinglePlayer>
    <SupportsMultiplayer>1</SupportsMultiplayer>
    <SupportsHotSeat>1</SupportsHotSeat>
    <SupportsMac>1</SupportsMac>
    <ReloadAudioSystem>0</ReloadAudioSystem>
    <ReloadLandmarkSystem>0</ReloadLandmarkSystem>
    <ReloadStrategicViewSystem>0</ReloadStrategicViewSystem>
    <ReloadUnitSystem>0</ReloadUnitSystem>
